# KI-008: Two catalysts do not justify multiplying their speed-up factors
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2O2 0.001mol
add v1 MnO2 0.001g
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 H2O2 0.001mol
add v2 catalase 0.000001g
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 H2O2 0.001mol
add v3 MnO2 0.001g
add v3 catalase 0.000001g
wait 10s
inspect
